      "imagePath": "images/02.jpg",
      "text": "Once upon a time, there were 5 Avengers in Avengers headquarters"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "imagePath": "images/03.jpg",
      "text": "One name was vision, another name was captain America, another name was War machine, another name was scarlet, another name was romanof"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "imagePath": "images/04.jpg",
      "text": "One day, Captain went alone in the woods inside the Avengers Quinjet"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "imagePath": "images/05.jpg",
      "text": "then the other Avengers woke up"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "imagePath": "images/06.jpg",
      "text": "then they had their breakfast..."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "imagePath": "images/07.jpg",
      "text": "and started watching TV."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "imagePath": "images/08.jpg",
      "text": "But they forgot about Captain."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "imagePath": "images/09.jpg",
      "text": "then War Machine reminded them about him."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "imagePath": "images/10.jpg",
      "text": "All the avengers had coms"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "imagePath": "images/11.jpg",
      "text": "but... Captain had a detector in his com"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "imagePath": "images/12.jpg",
      "text": "They located Captain in the woods."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "imagePath": "images/13.jpg",
      "text": "The Avengers walked through the woods."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "imagePath": "images/14.jpg",
      "text": "Just then they heard a sound...."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "imagePath": "images/15.jpg",
      "text": "It was the Green Goblin"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "imagePath": "images/16.jpg",
      "text": "Green Goblin reached Captain and started attacking him"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "imagePath": "images/17.jpg",
      "text": "and all the Avengers started fighting with him and the Goblin was defeated."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
